28
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:46,840
They'll grow up with it,

29
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:47,650
the way you grew

30
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:48,950
up with electricity.

31
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,220
And the more that machine can do,

32
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:52,570
the more a few human

33
