63
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,350
But on that survey's

64
00:01:43,390 --> 00:01:44,330
list of worries,

65
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:45,480
it came last.

66
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:46,670
And most of them

67
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:48,160
