68
00:01:48,530 --> 00:01:50,640
And this child starts life safer

69
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,810
than almost any child before.

70
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,880
In a single generation,

71
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,990
the number of children who

72
