Six years later.

85
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:19,070
2032.

86
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,440
First grade.

87
00:02:20,690 --> 00:02:21,540
Your child has

88
00:02:21,580 --> 00:02:23,200
