91
00:02:27,070 --> 00:02:28,070
The fear?

92
00:02:28,210 --> 00:02:30,040
If the machine does the thinking,

93
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,040
your child never learns to.

94
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,490
But schools have already

95
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:35,210
tried an early version.

96
00:02:35,370 --> 00:02:37,380
And something else went wrong.

97
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:39,480
Stanford researchers gave

98
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,390
elementary school children in two

99
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:43,440
districts a reading tutor built

100
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:44,690
on today's artificial

101
00:02:44,730 --> 00:02:45,750
intelligence.

102
00:02:46,170 --> 00:02:47,090
Among the kids left

103
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:48,590
to use it on their own,

104
