four in ten never logged

105
00:02:50,550 --> 00:02:51,940
on in one district.

106
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:54,010
In the other, nearly half.

107
00:02:54,250 --> 00:02:55,460
Not once.

108
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:57,490
The tutor was ready.

109
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,580
Those children never asked.

110
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:01,300
Other big trials this

111
00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:02,880
year point the same way.

112
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,810
On its own,

113
00:03:03,850 --> 00:03:04,700
a machine tutor

114
