146
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:58,750
Twelve.

147
00:03:58,830 --> 00:04:00,240
2038.

148
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,510
This friend is always awake,

149
00:04:02,550 --> 00:04:03,790
never in a bad mood,

150
00:04:03,830 --> 00:04:05,800
and never needs anything back.

151
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:06,800
Next to that,

152
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,740
why would a child

153
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:09,180
bother with people?

154
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,020
Ask the teenagers who already

155
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,140
use chatbots as companions.

156
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,750
In a survey last year,

157
00:04:14,790 --> 00:04:16,020
a third had talked about

158
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:17,860
something serious with the machine

159
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,360
