183
00:05:01,450 --> 00:05:02,450
Want that too?

184
00:05:02,590 --> 00:05:03,650
Then subscribe.

185
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:07,510
So trust becomes more valuable.

186
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,800
But can trust pay the rent?

187
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:11,900
Eighteen.

188
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,400
2044.

189
00:05:13,810 --> 00:05:14,500
And the question

190
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:16,510
