192
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:20,500
"What should I be?"

193
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:23,610
Daniel Susskind is an economist

194
00:05:23,650 --> 00:05:24,740
who advises the British

195
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:26,120
government on artificial

196
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,800
intelligence and work.

197
