222
00:06:14,770 --> 00:06:16,120
Not programmer...

223
00:06:16,630 --> 00:06:17,860
Home care aide.

224
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,110
The person who helps your

225
00:06:19,150 --> 00:06:20,830
