249
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,990
a job stops being

250
00:06:59,030 --> 00:07:00,270
the center of a life.

251
00:07:00,670 --> 00:07:02,530
So what takes its place?

252
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,530
Thirty.

253
00:07:04,570 --> 00:07:06,190
2056.

254
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,290
Your child is a grown-up.

255
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:09,920
Picture an ordinary

256
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,520
Tuesday on their street.

257
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:12,870
The machines carry

258
00:07:12,910 --> 00:07:14,120
