259
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:16,040
And the day has room in it.

260
00:07:16,210 --> 00:07:17,270
For their kids.

261
00:07:17,530 --> 00:07:18,310
For something they

262
00:07:18,350 --> 00:07:20,040
always wanted to build.

263
00:07:20,270 --> 00:07:22,470
That Tuesday isn't guaranteed.

264
00:07:22,710 --> 00:07:24,290
Who the machines work for,

265
00:07:24,330 --> 00:07:25,670
and under what rules,

266
00:07:25,710 --> 00:07:26,550
is not written

267
00:07:26,590 --> 00:07:27,930
into the technology.

268
00:07:28,250 --> 00:07:30,050
Daron Acemoglu won the Nobel

269
00:07:30,090 --> 00:07:32,280
Prize in economics two years ago.

270
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:34,260
He's one of the sharpest critics

271
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:35,350
of how these machines

272
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:36,420
are built today.

273
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,910
The direction of AI

274
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,210
is going to be whatever

275
00:07:39,250 --> 00:07:43,190
the leading companies decide.

276
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:45,010
But we have huge influence

277
00:07:45,050 --> 00:07:46,110
on these companies,

278
00:07:46,150 --> 00:07:46,870
which so far

279
00:07:46,910 --> 00:07:48,470
we have not exercised.

280
00:07:49,010 --> 00:07:50,070
So that Tuesday

281
00:07:50,110 --> 00:07:51,780
is being decided now.

282
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:52,600
In the labs

283
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,170
