284
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:55,510
In governments.

285
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,960
At the ballot box.

286
00:07:57,010 --> 00:07:58,160
By us.

287
00:07:58,320 --> 00:08:00,220
And what is your child for,

288
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:01,260
in a world that doesn't

289
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:02,330
need their labor?

290
00:08:02,610 --> 00:08:04,130
That one stays open.

291
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,460
But the person who answers

292
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:07,580
it is being raised right now.

293
00:08:07,730 --> 00:08:08,680
And that part isn't

294
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,090
